    {
      "id": 991000100009, "plugin": "Cardinal", "model": "TextEditor", "pos": [164, 0],
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "", "lang": "None", "width": 35,
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / REED CHAMBER ORGAN\n\nOriginal eight-voice two-manual combo-organ\nsketch; not a tonewheel emulation.\n8ft MorphVCO -> StateFilter LP -> DualVCA A\n4ft MorphVCO -> DualVCA B. Both feed stereo\necho and Cardinal HostAudio2 independently.\n\nHostMIDI PITCH drives both manuals; GATE and\nRETRIGGER feed a shared ADSR. The free-running\n3 Hz ClockedLFO adds subtle, phase-coherent\nvibrato to both oscillator frequency inputs.\n\nMacro8 A: Chapel, B: Reed, C: Swirl, D: Shimmer.\nEight macros control waveform, filter, echo\nand upper-manual pulse width. Morph time 1.2 s.\nThe upper manual stays one octave above the\nlower manual and is lightly detuned.\n\nKeep initial monitoring level very low.\nNo fork-DAW audio or organ quality audition\nhas been performed; source routing only.\n"
      }
    }
